0020:     - The rectangles are the foreground objects to preserve above the new bars.
0021: 
0022:     Rule:
0023:     - Detect the blue rectangle outline objects against the teal background.
0024:     - Draw a pink full row and full column through each rectangle center.
0025:     - Redraw the original rectangles over the bars.
